{"version":1,"content":"<p>科學家警告稱，覆蓋地球表面的薄薄一層土壤，支撐着人類絕大多數食物生產，同時過濾水源、儲存大量碳並維繫無數生命。然而，儘管土壤對糧食安全、氣候穩定和生態系統至關重要，目前仍沒有一項專門、具有約束力的國際條約來保護它。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587652.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.503086+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:08:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_hash":"36b3135373b4b1ee838bcd4b1045d95c79b6156a22f5f0445df7cc0f18dfbeb8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}